        <mxCell id="s2_strip_load" value="• &lt;b&gt;K3S 12 V power supply&lt;/b&gt;&#10;• Laptop power brick&#10;• Behringer wall adapter&#10;• &lt;b&gt;VGA monitor&lt;/b&gt; power cord&#10;&#10;&lt;i&gt;Heaviest load of the four station strips because of the digital monitor.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
